What did I learn this week?

This week in English, I learned how to use the PETAL structure to write a short answer (SA). I also practised writing about the paper Mengrei, which explores culture clash. I learned how to organise my ideas and support them with evidence from the text.

What was challenging?

The challenging part was choosing good evidence and explaining how it connects to my point. Sometimes I know what I want to say, but I find it difficult to explain my ideas clearly.

What did I practise?

I practised using PETAL: Point, Evidence, Technique, Analysis, and Link. I used this structure to write about culture clash in Mengrei and explain how the writer presents differences between cultures.

What do I want to improve?

I want to get better at writing stronger analysis instead of just describing what happens in the text. I also want to use PETAL more naturally and make sure my evidence supports my argument.
